    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/ce9932f8d4967f1e861e26baa631c51c.poster.avif?t=1753267931\" width=640 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/ce9932f8d4967f1e861e26baa631c51c.webm?t=1753267931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/ce9932f8d4967f1e861e26baa631c51c.mp4?t=1753267931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BANANA TREASURE HUNT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a wild and unpredictable treasure hunt where bananas are the ultimate prize! In this thrilling tile-based adventure, players navigate a grid of mystery, uncovering hidden banana treasures while dodging sneaky traps and explosive surprises. Strategy, luck, and a touch of madness are your best allies in this race to become the ultimate treasure hunter. Are you ready to go bananas? \ud83c\udf4c\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana Loco is a single player game where players try to look for banana treasures within tiles. Players can use power-ups to help them navigate the map tiles. With the use of strategy and tile memorization, players can achieve high scores. Depending on the level, the quest for multiple treasures will be given to the treasure hunters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a treasure hunt within a set of tiles. Use power-ups to gain an advantage. Use them wisely because they're limited. Achieve high scores by collecting many banana treasures!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Exploration</strong>: Players reveal tiles on the map to uncover treasures or hidden surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels:</strong> Reach more difficult levels by earning treasure scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banana Treasures</strong>: Collect valuable banana treasures to win the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Power-ups</strong>: Use power-ups for your advantage to easily find the treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong>: Watch out for traps among hidden tiles that can hinder your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals</strong>: Earn medals by achieving certain high scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/6b3900799301cb6fa9689c0483c0469d.avif?t=1753267931\" width=604 height=209 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/ce9932f8d4967f1e861e26baa631c51c.poster.avif?t=1753267931\" width=640 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/ce9932f8d4967f1e861e26baa631c51c.webm?t=1753267931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/ce9932f8d4967f1e861e26baa631c51c.mp4?t=1753267931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BANANA TREASURE HUNT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a wild and unpredictable treasure hunt where bananas are the ultimate prize! In this thrilling tile-based adventure, players navigate a grid of mystery, uncovering hidden banana treasures while dodging sneaky traps and explosive surprises. Strategy, luck, and a touch of madness are your best allies in this race to become the ultimate treasure hunter. Are you ready to go bananas? \ud83c\udf4c\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana Loco is a single player game where players try to look for banana treasures within tiles. Players can use power-ups to help them navigate the map tiles. With the use of strategy and tile memorization, players can achieve high scores. Depending on the level, the quest for multiple treasures will be given to the treasure hunters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a treasure hunt within a set of tiles. Use power-ups to gain an advantage. Use them wisely because they're limited. Achieve high scores by collecting many banana treasures!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Exploration</strong>: Players reveal tiles on the map to uncover treasures or hidden surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels:</strong> Reach more difficult levels by earning treasure scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banana Treasures</strong>: Collect valuable banana treasures to win the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Power-ups</strong>: Use power-ups for your advantage to easily find the treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong>: Watch out for traps among hidden tiles that can hinder your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals</strong>: Earn medals by achieving certain high scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658850/extras/6b3900799301cb6fa9689c0483c0469d.avif?t=1753267931\" width=604 height=209 /></span></p>",
